</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S5.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">D-Wave Dataset Comparison.</span></figcaption>
